    {
      "id": "p0239-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In many role-playing games, the player must earn \"EXP\" (short for \"Experience Points\") to increase their \"LV\" (short for \"Level\"). These standard terms appear in Undertale too, but it's eventually revealed that \"EXP\" and \"LV\" actually stand for \"execution points\" and \"level of violence\" here in the Underground.",
        "raw": "In many role-playing games, the player must earn \"EXP\" (short for \"Experience\nPoints\") to increase their \"LV\" (short for \"Level\"). These standard terms appear\nin Undertale too, but it's eventually revealed that \"EXP\" and \"LV\" actually stand\nfor \"execution points\" and \"level of violence\" here in the Underground.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.0971802,
          0.56034286,
          0.69554897,
          0.62798571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09422426,
          0.55962857,
          0.70025206,
          0.62905714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          29,
          30,
          31,
          32
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "许多角色扮演游戏中，玩家要积累 EXP（Experience Points，经验值）来提升 LV（Level，等级）。《Undertale》也用了这些常见术语，但最后揭晓：在地下世界里，EXP 和 LV 其实分别代表 execution points（处决点数）和 level of violence（暴力等级）。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
          {
            "start": 60,
            "end": 69,
            "italic": true,
            "lang": "en"
          }
        ]
